[[576,127,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               controls the compressor\nengagement circuit.</p><p>The relay receives a supply from the line\ncontrolled by the ignition (INT/A) for the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               protected\nby fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : both are housed in the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The coil is supplied by the line from fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nthe additional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98 A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , of the main injection relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ;\nthe relay is thus energized by an earth signal coming from the engine\nmanagement control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : in this way the air conditioning\ncompressor engagement electro-magnet \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is operated through a\nvoltage of 12 V.</p><p>Climate control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ( pin 7\nof connector A) sends a compressor enablement signal to four-stage\npressure switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . If circuit pressures are correct, the\nsignal leaves the pressure switch and reaches engine control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               - pin\n60 of connector A. According to its internal control logic, the\ncontrol unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends - from pin 18 of connector A - the\ncommand to engage the compressor which energizes the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]